Original commit body from b4c5818:

- Add _estimate_file_block_tokens() to accurately estimate tokens for
  file content blocks including START/END markers and code fences
- Use accurate estimation for both Source Content and Additional File
  Content sections to prevent mid-file truncation
- Ensure sketch output always ends with a newline (standard for text files)

Previously, token estimation only counted file content, not the ~130 chars
of overhead from markers. This caused files to be included that pushed the
sketch over budget, resulting in mid-file truncation by truncate_to_tokens().
